  "notes": "A news word.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {拉致|らち}⟦{問題|もんだい}→問題：00797_mondai⟧: the abduction issue (North Korea)\n- {拉致|らち}⟦{被害者|ひがいしゃ}→被害者：14106_higaisha⟧: abductee\n- {拉致|らち}⟦{監禁|かんきん}→監禁：13647_kankin⟧: abduction and confinement\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{誘拐|ゆうかい}→誘拐：14210_yuukai⟧: kidnapping — often by luring, especially of children, typically for ransom; {拉致|らち} stresses force\n- ⟦{監禁|かんきん}→監禁：13647_kankin⟧: confinement — holding someone captive",
